  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNODC - Strategic response to counter-cybercrime capacity building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The need for a strategic response, the specific challenges of SE Asia and West Africa. Using UNODC staff with the knowledge, skills and experience to counter cybercrime through capacity-building. This approach gives a longer-term, sustainable response than simply conducting stand-alone training events.</narrative>
  </description>
